        "original_id": "f4e8a786-9db9-56f3-8651-9bab4eac55db",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack McBrayer, Jack Donaghy, Liz Lemon, Tracy Jordan, Kenneth Parcell, Alec Baldwin, Tina Fey, Tracy Morgan\n- Works: \"Cooter\" (30 Rock), \"Wreck-It Ralph\", \"Phineas and Ferb\", \"Wander Over Yonder\", \"The Middle\"\n- Roles: Dr. Ted Goodwin, NBC page\n- Topics: politics, pregnancy scare, adoption, pornographic video game, Beijing Olympics\n\nFacts:\n- In the \"30 Rock\" episode \"Cooter,\" Jack Donaghy, played by Alec Baldwin, tries to get fired from his new job in politics.\n- In the \"30 Rock\" episode \"Cooter,\" Liz Lemon, played by Tina Fey, has a pregnancy scare and decides to adopt a baby.\n- In the \"30 Rock\" episode \"Cooter,\" Tracy Jordan, played by Tracy Morgan, creates a pornographic video game.\n- In the \"30 Rock\" episode \"Cooter,\" Kenneth Parcell, played by Jack McBrayer, aspires to be an NBC page at the Beijing Olympics.\n- Jack McBrayer has voiced characters in \"Wreck-It Ralph,\" \"Phineas and Ferb,\" and \"Wander Over Yonder.\"\n- Jack McBrayer currently plays Dr. Ted Goodwin, a recurring character on the ABC sitcom \"The Middle\".",
